/*/{Protheus.doc} setInterface
Monta a interface de Fatores I.Q.S. via layout automatico. QIEA271
(QIEA270 com nOpcao=2) nao tem legenda, cor ou acao customizada
propria.
@type method
@author willian.ramalho
@since 25/08/2026
/*/
method setInterface() class QualityFactorsIQSInterface
    Local cModel := "totvs.protheus.manufacturing.incominginspection.QualityFactorsIQSModel" as character

    ::oInterface := BuildContract():new("qualityfactorsiqs")
    ::oInterface:setModelId(cModel, .T.)
    ::oInterface:setTitle(STR0001) // STR0001 - "Fatores I.Q.S."
    ::oInterface:buildStandardView()
return
